<http://weee-kg.org/source:A%20Copper-Catalyzed%20Bioleaching%20Process%20for%20Enhancement%20of%20Cobalt%20Dissolution%20from%20Spent%20Lithium-Ion%20Batteries:Process_A__ferrooxidans_bioleaching_with_0_01_g_L_copper_ion> a weee:Process ;
    rdfs:label "A. ferrooxidans bioleaching with 0.01 g/L copper ion" ;
    weee:description "A. ferrooxidans bioleaching with 0.01 g/L copper ion is a source-specific Process entity in the study A Copper-Catalyzed Bioleaching Process for Enhancement of Cobalt Dissolution from Spent Lithium-Ion Batteries. Scope: Bioleaching of LiCoO2 with Acidithiobacillus ferrooxidans in 9K medium at 1% pulp density, 5% (v/v) inoculum, pH 2.0, 35°C, 160 rpm for 10 days; CuSO4·5H2O added simultaneously with LiCoO2 to give 0.01 g/L copper ion; Co concentration determined over 10 days. Quantitative observations concern: Co." ;
    weee:hasScopeContext <http://weee-kg.org/context/scope/1322b977e5c3d05df7ed4de3> ;
    rel:hasResultObservation <http://weee-kg.org/source:A%20Copper-Catalyzed%20Bioleaching%20Process%20for%20Enhancement%20of%20Cobalt%20Dissolution%20from%20Spent%20Lithium-Ion%20Batteries:Observation_REL_Process_A__ferrooxidans_bioleaching_with_0_01_g_L_copper_ion_HAS_OUTPUT_Material_Co_10231377d4d96b7b> ;
    rel:memberOfMethodFamily <http://weee-kg.org/anchor:MethodFamily:bioleaching> .

