        <http://weee-kg.org/source:Bioleaching%20of%20Valuable%20Metals%20from%20Spent%20Lithium-Ion%20Mobile%20Phone%20Batteries%20Using%20Aspergillus%20Niger:Observation_REL_Process_two_step_bioleaching_HAS_OUTPUT_Material_Mn_e2e159019472b524> ;
    rel:memberOfMethodFamily <http://weee-kg.org/anchor:MethodFamily:bioleaching> .

<http://weee-kg.org/source:Chemical%20Characterisation%20of%20Spent%20Rechargeable%20Batteries:Process_EN_12457_2_leaching_test> a weee:Process ;
