    weee:description "EN 12457-2 leaching test is a source-specific Process entity in the study Chemical Characterisation of Spent Rechargeable Batteries. Scope: Liquid to solid ratio was 10/1 and the suspension was agitated by an overhead shaker (5 rpm) for 24 h at room temperature (20 ± 5 °C). Quantitative observations concern: Cd, Co, Cu, Fe, Li." ;
