<http://weee-kg.org/source:Synthesis%20and%20Performance%20of%20Li%5B%28ni13co13mn13%291%E2%88%92mg%20%5Do2%20Prepared%20from%20Spent%20Lithium%20Ion%20Batteries:Process_NaF_deposition> a weee:Process ;
    rdfs:label "NaF deposition" ;
    weee:description "NaF deposition is a source-specific Process entity in the study Synthesis and Performance of Li[(ni13co13mn13)1−mg ]o2 Prepared from Spent Lithium Ion Batteries. Scope: If the concentration of magnesium ion remained in the leachate exceeds the limitation of national standard, NaF deposition method is used to remove the Mg ^2+ ion." ;
    weee:hasScopeContext <http://weee-kg.org/context/scope/8bc872aab99b62983ae56535> ;
    rel:memberOfMethodFamily <http://weee-kg.org/anchor:MethodFamily:deposition> .

<http://weee-kg.org/source:Synthesis%20and%20Performance%20of%20Li%5B%28ni13co13mn13%291%E2%88%92mg%20%5Do2%20Prepared%20from%20Spent%20Lithium%20Ion%20Batteries:Process_co_precipitation> a weee:Process ;
    rdfs:label "co-precipitation" ;
    weee:description "co-precipitation is a source-specific Process entity in the study Synthesis and Performance of Li[(ni13co13mn13)1−mg ]o2 Prepared from Spent Lithium Ion Batteries. Scope: Co-precipitation is used to synthesize Li[(Ni1/3Co1/3Mn1/3)1-xMgx]O2 (x = 0, 0.01, 0.025, 0.05) cathode materials by doping with magnesium." ;
    weee:hasScopeContext <http://weee-kg.org/context/scope/b26860b04074a1d95b472337> ;
    rel:memberOfMethodFamily <http://weee-kg.org/anchor:MethodFamily:co-precipitation> .

<http://weee-kg.org/source:Synthesis%20and%20Performance%20of%20Li%5B%28ni13co13mn13%291%E2%88%92mg%20%5Do2%20Prepared%20from%20Spent%20Lithium%20Ion%20Batteries:Process_high_temperature_sintering> a weee:Process ;
    rdfs:label "high temperature sintering" ;
    weee:description "high temperature sintering is a source-specific Process entity in the study Synthesis and Performance of Li[(ni13co13mn13)1−mg ]o2 Prepared from Spent Lithium Ion Batteries. Scope: Magnesium was added during co-precipitation process followed by high temperature sintering using the recovered metal sulfate salts of NiSO4, CoSO4, and MnSO4 as staring materials." ;
    weee:hasScopeContext <http://weee-kg.org/context/scope/1446bab511b0598d29746e3e> ;
    rel:memberOfMethodFamily <http://weee-kg.org/anchor:MethodFamily:sintering> .

<http://weee-kg.org/source:Synthesis%20and%20Performance%20of%20Li%5B%28ni13co13mn13%291%E2%88%92mg%20%5Do2%20Prepared%20from%20Spent%20Lithium%20Ion%20Batteries:Process_purification> a weee:Process ;
    rdfs:label "purification" ;
    weee:description "purification is a source-specific Process entity in the study Synthesis and Performance of Li[(ni13co13mn13)1−mg ]o2 Prepared from Spent Lithium Ion Batteries. Scope: Recycling process consists of thermal treatment, crushing, ball milling, sieving, secondary alkaline leaching, secondary acid leaching and purification." ;
    weee:hasScopeContext <http://weee-kg.org/context/scope/fea0e89c1f4ddc2a3e745332> ;
    rel:memberOfMethodFamily <http://weee-kg.org/anchor:MethodFamily:purification> .

