<http://weee-kg.org/source:Bioleaching%20of%20Valuable%20Metals%20from%20Spent%20Lithium-Ion%20Mobile%20Phone%20Batteries%20Using%20Aspergillus%20Niger:Process_spent_medium_bioleaching> a weee:Process ;
    rdfs:label "spent medium bioleaching" ;
    weee:description "spent medium bioleaching is a source-specific Process entity in the study Bioleaching of Valuable Metals from Spent Lithium-Ion Mobile Phone Batteries Using Aspergillus Niger. Scope: At last, the battery powder was added to the filtrate which included fungal metabolites and then bioleached in a shaker-incubator for 16 days. Quantitative observations concern: Al, Co, Cu, Li, Mn." ;
