    weee:description "solvent method for scrap material recovery is a source-specific Process entity in the study Heat Treatment of Licoo2 Recovered from Cathode Scraps with Solvent Method. Scope: Separated Al foil was treated again with the solvent method to enhance recovery rate of scrap materials and purity of Al foil; most scrap materials (m1) were directly recovered after the solvent method. Quantitative observations concern: acetylene black, cathode active material." ;
