<http://weee-kg.org/source:Assessment%20of%20Smartphones%E2%80%99%20Components%20and%20Materials%20for%20a%20Recycling%20Perspective-%20Tendencies%20of%20Composition%20and%20Target%20Elements:Process_thermal_treatment__loss_on_ignition_> a weee:Process ;
    rdfs:label "thermal treatment (loss on ignition)" ;
    weee:description "thermal treatment (loss on ignition) is a source-specific Process entity in the study Assessment of Smartphones’ Components and Materials for a Recycling Perspective- Tendencies of Composition and Target Elements. Scope: Dry 3–5 g samples of milled smartphone components at 100 °C for 2 h, then ignite in alumina crucibles in a muffle furnace at 550 °C for 80 min; cool to room temperature, dry again at 100 °C for 2 h, and measure mass loss." ;
    weee:hasScopeContext <http://weee-kg.org/context/scope/329a157368f72c6b1f71b955> ;
    rel:memberOfMethodFamily <http://weee-kg.org/anchor:MethodFamily:thermal_treatment> .

<http://weee-kg.org/source:Green%20and%20Facile%20Method%20for%20the%20Recovery%20of%20Spent%20Lithium%20Nickel%20Manganese%20Cobalt%20Oxide%20%28NMC%29%20Based%20Lithium%20Ion%20Batteries:Process_metal_leaching_from_cathode_and_anode_film_using_citrus_pseudolimon_juice> a weee:Process ;
    rdfs:label "metal leaching from cathode and anode film using citrus pseudolimon juice" ;
    weee:description "metal leaching from cathode and anode film using citrus pseudolimon juice is a source-specific Process entity in the study Green and Facile Method for the Recovery of Spent Lithium Nickel Manganese Cobalt Oxide (NMC) Based Lithium Ion Batteries. Scope: Cathode and anode films from waste mobile phone LIBs were treated with Citrus pseudolimon (galgal) juice in a 250 mL round-bottom flask at a film-to-juice w/v ratio of 50,000 mg/L, 90 °C for 20 min for binder removal; after separating Cu and Al films, the remaining solution was refluxed for 30 min and filtered to remove carbon and impurities, and the filtrate was analyzed for leaching rate by ICP-MS relative to tri-acid digestion. Quantitative observations concern: Co, Li, Mn, Ni." ;
    weee:hasScopeContext <http://weee-kg.org/context/scope/8c2d0c80f8a96e8d62139f5d> ;
    rel:hasResultObservation <http://weee-kg.org/source:Green%20and%20Facile%20Method%20for%20the%20Recovery%20of%20Spent%20Lithium%20Nickel%20Manganese%20Cobalt%20Oxide%20%28NMC%29%20Based%20Lithium%20Ion%20Batteries:Observation_REL_Process_metal_leaching_from_cathode_and_anode_film_using_citrus_pseudolimon_juice_HAS_OUTPUT_Material_Co_d5566fbb452ea12d>,
        <http://weee-kg.org/source:Green%20and%20Facile%20Method%20for%20the%20Recovery%20of%20Spent%20Lithium%20Nickel%20Manganese%20Cobalt%20Oxide%20%28NMC%29%20Based%20Lithium%20Ion%20Batteries:Observation_REL_Process_metal_leaching_from_cathode_and_anode_film_using_citrus_pseudolimon_juice_HAS_OUTPUT_Material_Li_be8fc2ba26826c5d>,
        <http://weee-kg.org/source:Green%20and%20Facile%20Method%20for%20the%20Recovery%20of%20Spent%20Lithium%20Nickel%20Manganese%20Cobalt%20Oxide%20%28NMC%29%20Based%20Lithium%20Ion%20Batteries:Observation_REL_Process_metal_leaching_from_cathode_and_anode_film_using_citrus_pseudolimon_juice_HAS_OUTPUT_Material_Mn_51dd2f1bdd1db47f>,
        <http://weee-kg.org/source:Green%20and%20Facile%20Method%20for%20the%20Recovery%20of%20Spent%20Lithium%20Nickel%20Manganese%20Cobalt%20Oxide%20%28NMC%29%20Based%20Lithium%20Ion%20Batteries:Observation_REL_Process_metal_leaching_from_cathode_and_anode_film_using_citrus_pseudolimon_juice_HAS_OUTPUT_Material_Ni_74ea2004c46bfdb4> ;
    rel:memberOfMethodFamily <http://weee-kg.org/anchor:MethodFamily:metal_leaching> .

<http://weee-kg.org/source:Synthesis%20and%20Performance%20of%20Li%5B%28ni13co13mn13%291%E2%88%92mg%20%5Do2%20Prepared%20from%20Spent%20Lithium%20Ion%20Batteries:Process_organic_solvent_extraction> a weee:Process ;
    rdfs:label "organic solvent extraction" ;
    weee:description "organic solvent extraction is a source-specific Process entity in the study Synthesis and Performance of Li[(ni13co13mn13)1−mg ]o2 Prepared from Spent Lithium Ion Batteries. Scope: Organic solvent extraction is used to recover NiSO4, CoSO4, and MnSO4 one by one from the purified leaching liquor, followed by corresponding scrubbing and stripping procedures." ;
    weee:hasScopeContext <http://weee-kg.org/context/scope/e7c3db05849208be2d9ef957> ;
    rel:hasOutput <http://weee-kg.org/entity/CoSO4>,
        <http://weee-kg.org/entity/MnSO4>,
        <http://weee-kg.org/entity/NiSO4> ;
    rel:memberOfMethodFamily <http://weee-kg.org/anchor:MethodFamily:solvent_extraction> .

<http://weee-kg.org/source:Ultrasound-Assisted%20Leaching%20of%20Cobalt%20and%20Lithium%20from%20Spent%20Lithium-Ion%20Batteries:Component_cathode> a weee:Component ;
    rdfs:label "cathode" ;
    weee:description "cathode is a source-specific Component entity in the study Ultrasound-Assisted Leaching of Cobalt and Lithium from Spent Lithium-Ion Batteries. Scope: Cathode materials separated from the aluminum foil of spent LIBs using N-Methyl-2-pyrrolidone (NMP)." ;
    weee:hasScopeContext <http://weee-kg.org/context/scope/19566ecaff7f82f1089b955d> .

<http://weee-kg.org/source:Ultrasound-Assisted%20Leaching%20of%20Cobalt%20and%20Lithium%20from%20Spent%20Lithium-Ion%20Batteries:Process_ultrasound_assisted_leaching_of_Co_and_Li_from_calcined_cathode_material> a weee:Process ;
    rdfs:label "ultrasound-assisted leaching of Co and Li from calcined cathode material" ;
    weee:description "ultrasound-assisted leaching of Co and Li from calcined cathode material is a source-specific Process entity in the study Ultrasound-Assisted Leaching of Cobalt and Lithium from Spent Lithium-Ion Batteries. Scope: The ultrasonic probe was placed in the solution during the ultrasound-assisted leaching experiments. Quantitative observations concern: Co, Li." ;
    weee:hasScopeContext <http://weee-kg.org/context/scope/26c5d91bcdac8173cb4c55a2> ;
    rel:hasResultObservation <http://weee-kg.org/source:Ultrasound-Assisted%20Leaching%20of%20Cobalt%20and%20Lithium%20from%20Spent%20Lithium-Ion%20Batteries:Observation_REL_Process_ultrasound_assisted_leaching_of_Co_and_Li_from_calcined_cathode_material_HAS_OUTPUT_Material_Co_0bda7aa6c17a28bc>,
