<http://weee-kg.org/source:A%20Comprehensive%20Characterization%20of%20End-of-Life%20Mobile%20Phones%20for%20Secondary%20Material%20Resources%20Identification:Process_aqua_regia_leaching_of_comminuted_solid_residues> a weee:Process ;
    rdfs:label "aqua regia leaching of comminuted solid residues" ;
    weee:description "aqua regia leaching of comminuted solid residues is a source-specific Process entity in the study A Comprehensive Characterization of End-of-Life Mobile Phones for Secondary Material Resources Identification. Scope: Comminute solid residues using a cutting mill to <1 mm and a planetary ball mill for fineness and homogeneity, then leach again with fresh aqua regia at 25 °C; after leaching, separate solids by filtration, wash with distilled water, and dry to assess mass balance. Quantitative observations concern: C, H, N, O, S." ;
    weee:hasScopeContext <http://weee-kg.org/context/scope/41bec901ec172c28cb5ad696> ;
    rel:hasResultObservation <http://weee-kg.org/source:A%20Comprehensive%20Characterization%20of%20End-of-Life%20Mobile%20Phones%20for%20Secondary%20Material%20Resources%20Identification:Observation_REL_Process_aqua_regia_leaching_of_comminuted_solid_residues_HAS_OUTPUT_Material_C_64d72d7c28b22e25>,
        <http://weee-kg.org/source:A%20Comprehensive%20Characterization%20of%20End-of-Life%20Mobile%20Phones%20for%20Secondary%20Material%20Resources%20Identification:Observation_REL_Process_aqua_regia_leaching_of_comminuted_solid_residues_HAS_OUTPUT_Material_H_6742eb0b2da46058>,
