        <http://weee-kg.org/source:A%20Comprehensive%20Characterization%20of%20End-of-Life%20Mobile%20Phones%20for%20Secondary%20Material%20Resources%20Identification:Observation_REL_Process_aqua_regia_leaching_of_comminuted_solid_residues_HAS_OUTPUT_Material_O_cbf3f369c00d6972>,
        <http://weee-kg.org/source:A%20Comprehensive%20Characterization%20of%20End-of-Life%20Mobile%20Phones%20for%20Secondary%20Material%20Resources%20Identification:Observation_REL_Process_aqua_regia_leaching_of_comminuted_solid_residues_HAS_OUTPUT_Material_S_13b10d4797aa13dc> ;
    rel:memberOfMethodFamily <http://weee-kg.org/anchor:MethodFamily:aqua_regia_leaching> .

