<http://weee-kg.org/source:Pneumatic%20Separation%20and%20Recycling%20of%20Anode%20and%20Cathode%20Materials%20from%20Spent%20Lithium%20Iron%20Phosphate%20Batteries:Process_pneumatic_separation_of_crushed_battery_core_product> a weee:Process ;
    rdfs:label "pneumatic separation of crushed battery core product" ;
    weee:description "pneumatic separation of crushed battery core product is a source-specific Process entity in the study Pneumatic Separation and Recycling of Anode and Cathode Materials from Spent Lithium Iron Phosphate Batteries. Scope: Crushed lithium iron phosphate power battery core products (copper and aluminum foil current collectors with particle sizes 3–15 mm, dissociated electrode powders) are fed into a pneumatic separation system where airflow velocity and inclination angle separate materials based on aerodynamic drag and gravity; the process is modeled with horizontal and vertical motion equations accounting for drag force, buoyancy, additional mass force, Saffman lift, Basset force, Magnus force, and pressure gradient force, with particle-wall and particle-particle interactions neglected. Quantitative observations concern: Al, Cu." ;
    weee:hasScopeContext <http://weee-kg.org/context/scope/1dca63a76aa7242b176f1510> ;
    rel:hasResultObservation <http://weee-kg.org/source:Pneumatic%20Separation%20and%20Recycling%20of%20Anode%20and%20Cathode%20Materials%20from%20Spent%20Lithium%20Iron%20Phosphate%20Batteries:Observation_REL_Process_pneumatic_separation_of_crushed_battery_core_product_HAS_OUTPUT_Material_Al_b78d33be4391e5d1>,
        <http://weee-kg.org/source:Pneumatic%20Separation%20and%20Recycling%20of%20Anode%20and%20Cathode%20Materials%20from%20Spent%20Lithium%20Iron%20Phosphate%20Batteries:Observation_REL_Process_pneumatic_separation_of_crushed_battery_core_product_HAS_OUTPUT_Material_Cu_9577e618677ca1df> ;
    rel:memberOfMethodFamily <http://weee-kg.org/anchor:MethodFamily:pneumatic_separation> .

<http://weee-kg.org/source:Pyrolysis-Ultrasonic-Assisted%20Flotation%20Technology%20for%20Recovering%20Graphite%20and%20Licoosub2sub%20from%20Spent%20Lithium-Ion%20Batteries:Component_lithium_ion_battery> a weee:Component ;
